} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056370}] :question/id #uuid "a3970135-b09a-510a-8a49-4f060f0ca725" :question/math-academy-id "q-119175" :question/problem "What is the exact value of $\\sin 345^{∘}$?\n\n*Hint: Use the fact that $345^{∘} = 300^{∘} + 45^{∘}$.*"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060103 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "487e22e1-54bd-51d6-863d-10475f2000c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186282302} {:answer/id #uuid "4ed9f056-d1a9-573b-9183-1e03d8b72004" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186282365} {:answer/id #uuid "4f6663c6-af0b-5715-97f3-659787c5835c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186282371} {:answer/id #uuid "570b6c79-4aa5-5bbf-8d05-cdecd9374d0e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{6}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186282428} {:answer/id #uuid "7e845f7f-9675-5c66-9d46-6e6ac9369ec2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186282780}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e845f7f-9675-5c66-9d46-6e6ac9369ec2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186282780} :answer-field/id #uuid "e92b5d50-5aa6-5f5d-9324-c7c10bad93f9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284346}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d93d90d2-8105-59cb-a801-47640240ddbd" :question/math-academy-id "q-1708" :question/problem "What is the exact value of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\right)?$\n\n*Hint: Use the fact that $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{5\\pi }{12}=\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\frac{\\pi }{6}.\n$$*" :question/worked-solution "Recall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ and $y=\\frac{\\pi }{6}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\right) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\right) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\right)\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\right)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\right)\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233846 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f304e544-6270-59ca-8530-7fe512d813f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232693}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f304e544-6270-59ca-8530-7fe512d813f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232693} :answer-field/id #uuid "26f525fd-4e20-5cfa-b8f9-f15c5b49c8e2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232692}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "2f345820-3d37-51b7-9bb6-51dedb3880f8" :question/math-academy-id "q-332158" :question/problem "Using the fact that ${75}^{∘}={45}^{∘}+{30}^{∘},$\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\operatorname{sin}({75}^{∘}).$\n\n$\\operatorname{sin}({75}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}(x+y)=\\operatorname{sin}x\\operatorname{cos}y+\\operatorname{cos}x\\operatorname{sin}y\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $x={45}^{∘}$ and $y={30}^{∘}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}({75}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}({45}^{∘}+{30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}({45}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}({30}^{∘})+\\operatorname{cos}({45}^{∘})\\operatorname{sin}({30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233847 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "72643f05-90c6-52af-b240-b68a55683fea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232695}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "72643f05-90c6-52af-b240-b68a55683fea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232695} :answer-field/id #uuid "689caa53-b486-5c31-b472-9df979e0142f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232694}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "16e4e461-f621-53d1-96fa-7b2df72cfebc" :question/math-academy-id "q-332159" :question/problem "Using the fact that ${105}^{∘}={60}^{∘}+{45}^{∘},$\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\operatorname{sin}({105}^{∘}).$\n\n$\\operatorname{sin}({105}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}(x+y)=\\operatorname{sin}x\\operatorname{cos}y+\\operatorname{cos}x\\operatorname{sin}y\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $x={60}^{∘}$ and $y={45}^{∘}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}({105}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}({60}^{∘}+{45}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}({60}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}({45}^{∘})+\\operatorname{cos}({60}^{∘})\\operatorname{sin}({45}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253530 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "40e39a76-ec70-50ca-864d-8989ec887a8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251092} {:answer/id #uuid "47eab5b2-3e2c-5dd1-a458-23a91c1a4181" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251149} {:answer/id #uuid "5003212d-ce1d-5519-a755-5603e3a28c20" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251208} {:answer/id #uuid "780276bd-face-56f9-94f9-639f97133c74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251545} {:answer/id #uuid "ab7c0a1f-74f2-5b0c-a9a5-180fd3015b26" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+1}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252040}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "47eab5b2-3e2c-5dd1-a458-23a91c1a4181" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251149} :answer-field/id #uuid "333cadb6-b105-5b48-8c09-a59a2a9c8b99" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252893}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "97e8e577-5bc3-50c1-b8c6-66747cc71a22" :question/math-academy-id "q-119007" :question/problem "What is the exact value of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡({75}^{∘})?$" :question/worked-solution "The angle ${75}^{∘}$ is not a special angle. However, we can rewrite it as the sum of two special angles, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{75}^{∘}={45}^{∘}+{30}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now recall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $x={45}^{∘}$ and $y={30}^{∘},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({75}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({45}^{∘}+{30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡{45}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292748 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e8ec2a45-2842-5b4c-acdd-a649ac1b1c6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291607}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e8ec2a45-2842-5b4c-acdd-a649ac1b1c6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291607} :answer-field/id #uuid "db846e3e-68fd-593b-bfb4-4529425488f8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292415}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "996eb380-c7f3-58b2-8258-bc17318d5244" :question/math-academy-id "q-274557" :question/problem "Using the fact that ${75}^{∘}={135}^{∘}-{60}^{∘},$\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡{75}^{∘}.$\n\n$\\operatorname{sin}⁡({75}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $x={135}^{∘}$ and $y={60}^{∘},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{75}^{∘} & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({135}^{∘}-{60}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡{135}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{60}^{∘}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{135}^{∘}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{60}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}+\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{6}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335834 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b7e71a1-540f-5903-a353-483cfa6ced0c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333552} {:answer/id #uuid "573aace2-d7ed-5759-b52b-c897e1f38e81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333785} {:answer/id #uuid "5af8090f-e014-5587-901a-3c106f54a0c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333821} {:answer/id #uuid "a99a4457-c774-5779-bb5c-5a973ede85f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334476} {:answer/id #uuid "b486a69e-1f42-5339-a393-a6f36f33f348" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334570}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a99a4457-c774-5779-bb5c-5a973ede85f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334476} :answer-field/id #uuid "c9707a27-b3b6-57dc-891d-4427cb25a436" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335610}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "585e18d7-2aa5-5d3f-86ad-587ffce85678" :question/math-academy-id "q-65427" :question/problem "What is the exact value of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-{105}^{∘})?$\n\n*Hint: Use the fact that $-{105}^{∘}={30}^{∘}-{135}^{∘}.$*" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $x={30}^{∘}$ and $y={135}^{∘},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-{105}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({30}^{∘}-{135}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{135}^{∘}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{135}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{6}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335835 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "51a9cbb7-6557-56b8-b41b-efdef54412d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333737} {:answer/id #uuid "81b1e9cd-c7a9-5810-8b9f-efc4191b4b23" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334141} {:answer/id #uuid "8bbeb5ca-4805-5bb3-a579-86a166eaad07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334236} {:answer/id #uuid "a67c9e7d-c929-590e-863b-c57c5938356f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334445} {:answer/id #uuid "cfa5d35b-d0a6-5ef1-baa6-529dd89b4095" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334799}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8bbeb5ca-4805-5bb3-a579-86a166eaad07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334236} :answer-field/id #uuid "e62b1cc7-51fe-56a3-bfd4-d5243e6b80e1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335640}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "4bf1dbaf-6e61-5607-8543-7f1dda28cf3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-65430" :question/problem "What is the exact value of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{11\\pi }{12}\\right)?$\n\n*Hint: Use the fact that $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{11\\pi }{12}=\\frac{7\\pi }{6}-\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\n$$*" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{6}$ and $y=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{11\\pi }{12}\\right) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}-\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\right) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}\\right)\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\right)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}\\right)\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\right) \\\\  & =\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186701916 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b52f88f-18cb-5753-85fe-8d7f8eb778fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{-\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701915} {:answer/id #uuid "6ea37bed-b167-5a45-b750-dcb389422d8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701921} {:answer/id #uuid "a0c83661-4e54-5920-87fc-9f91b2deb0b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701927} {:answer/id #uuid "a5108ff9-4282-561d-b3a4-a9fe0ad38549" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{-\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701928} {:answer/id #uuid "c3570ce1-fca8-52a7-9c3f-ec89e9f44b57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701932}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a5108ff9-4282-561d-b3a4-a9fe0ad38549" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{-\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701928} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce5dda4b-8d6a-5fb7-a28e-6b140e50d489" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701933}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3c63f1f8-2a20-54cf-ba8d-ad06ceaa1128" :question/problem "What is the exact value of $\\sin\\left(345^\\circ\\right)$ without using a calculator?\n\n*Hint: Use the fact that $345^\\circ=210^\\circ+135^\\circ$.*" :question/worked-solution "Write the angle as a sum or difference of special angles: $345^\\circ=210^\\circ+135^\\circ$.\n\nRecall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\sin(x+y)=\\sin x\\cos y+\\cos x\\sin y\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed unit-circle values, multiply, and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sin\\left(345^\\circ\\right) &=\\sin\\left(210^\\circ+135^\\circ\\right) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(210^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(135^\\circ\\right)+\\cos\\left(210^\\circ\\right)\\sin\\left(135^\\circ\\right) \\\\ &=\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ &=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4} \\\\ &=\\frac{-\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186701917 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "28ba89eb-2af1-511e-95e7-20632cb5f03c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186701913} {:answer/id